  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Could be nice to be able to control most / all Sound settings through OSC : \n\n(and add steam key bindings if applicable when missing)\n\n1) All volume levels (main, world, voice, avatar ..) \n\n  + command to mute \n\n  + muffle (it'd set the level to ~5% level, would be especially useful for steamVR binding, since we can't really set a specific level value) \n\n  \n\n.\n\n2) Earmuff settings\n\n  At minimum the Earmuff + World sound levels muffling would be awesome. :)\n\n  I always go to club worlds with the music blasting, when someone talks to me suddently, I can't react fast enough and go to the sound settings to lower down the music volume + turn earmuff off, in order to ear them 😉\n\n  So being able to do that with OSC or key binding would be nice.\n\n  There's another Canny for Earmuff OSC : https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/1583-earmuff-osc-endpoints\n\n  But might as well implement most / all Volume settings, instead of a sporadic implementation of specific sub commands only imho. :)",
